OL,3,GNEWSAOverturned lorry causes delays on
OL,4,AA1(M)
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing delays on the A1(M)
OL,7,Fdue to an overturned lorry.
OL,9,FAll lanes were closed between junctions
OL,10,F60 and 61, at Bowburn, south of Durham,
OL,11,Fafter the HGV overturned and caused a
OL,12,Flarge spillage at about 05:14 GMT,
OL,13,FNational Highways said.
OL,15,FThe North East Ambulance Service said
OL,16,Fone person was taken to hospital and it
OL,17,Fdeployed two hazard response teams and
OL,18,Fan ambulance, which are still at the
OL,19,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
